# Cursor harness (always on)

You are in the **Cursor** harness. Full guide: `.cursor/AGENTS.md`.

## Scope

Cursor owns writes across the whole repo: `tooling/`, `doc/`, Lean4 / Lake
sources (`*.lean`, `ClassifierExpr/`, `PathMerge/`, `RV32IMC/`, `EBPF/`,
`lakefile.lean`, `lean-toolchain`, `lake-manifest.json`), `.cursor/`,
`README.md`, and `.github/`.

Do **not** refuse Lean or `doc/` edits. Do **not** delegate to an external
`omp` CLI, `spec-author`, or any other harness.

## Lean for tooling

Only the create/step expand FFI matters for product Rust paths. Do not grow
product code on other Lean APIs. Details in `.cursor/AGENTS.md`.
